## 4. FIELD MAPPING TABLES (Phase 3)

> **CRITICAL**: Tables ONLY - NO DataWeave code blocks
> **Placement**: Per template structure

### Data Sample Request
```
🚨 MANDATORY: DATA SAMPLE REQUEST
1. Source system output (JSON/XML/CSV)
2. Target system expected format
3. Lookup/reference data (if applicable)
Reply: paste / file / skip
```

### Table Formatting Best Practice
<!-- Integrated: 2026-01-04 -->

**Problem**: Using HTML `<br>` tags in markdown table cells causes rendering failures in some markdown viewers, displaying tables as plain text with visible pipe characters.

**Solution**: Replace HTML line breaks with commas or other plain text separators.

```markdown
❌ BAD - HTML breaks:
| Step | Details |
|------|---------|
| **1** | Path: `/api/v1/products`<br>ClientID enforced |

✅ GOOD - Plain text:
| Step | Details |
|------|---------|
| **1** | Path: `/api/v1/products`, ClientID enforced |
```

**Why**: Ensures proper markdown rendering across all viewers and maintains professional document presentation.

### Mapping Table Formats

**Simple:**
| Source Field | Target Field | Transformation | Notes |
|--------------|--------------|----------------|-------|
| `Account.Name` | `customer_name` | Direct | Required |

**Complex:**
| Source | Target | Logic | Example In | Example Out |
|--------|--------|-------|------------|-------------|
| `firstName + lastName` | `fullName` | Concat | "John", "Doe" | "John Doe" |

**Null Handling:**
| Field | Strategy | Default |
|-------|----------|---------|
| `middleName` | Skip if null | N/A |
| `country` | Default value | "US" |

**Validation:**
| Field | Validation | Error |
|-------|------------|-------|
| `email` | Regex pattern | 400 Invalid email |

