## 5. ERROR HANDLING STRATEGY (Phase 3)

> **Placement**: Per template structure
> **DLQ Strategy**: ONLY include if DLQ is actually used. DO NOT include "Not Applicable" sections.

## 6. DECISION MATRICES

### Error Handling Decisions
| Error Type | Retry? | Fallback |
|------------|--------|----------|
| Validation (400) | No | Reject |
| Auth (401/403) | No | Fail |
| Rate Limit (429) | Yes (backoff) | Queue |
| Timeout | Yes (3x) | DLQ |
| Server Error (5xx) | Yes (backoff) | DLQ |

### Retry Configuration
| Severity | Max Retries | Backoff |
|----------|-------------|---------|
| Transient | 3 | 2x from 1s |
| External | 5 | 2x from 5s |

### CloudHub Sizing (Optional)
| Use Case | vCore |
|----------|-------|
| Simple proxy | 0.1 |
| Standard API | 0.2 |
| Complex API | 0.5 |
| Data integration | 1.0 |

