## 7. PITFALLS CHECKLIST

### Common Pitfalls
| Category | Pitfall | Solution |
|----------|---------|----------|
| Architecture | Over-engineering | Match complexity to requirements |
| Architecture | Under-engineering | Decompose when >50 processors |
| Performance | HTTP in loops | Batch calls or parallel |
| Performance | Full dataset in memory | Use streaming for >10MB |
| Security | Hardcoded credentials | Use ${secure::*} |
| Security | Logging PII | Sanitize logs |
| Operations | No health check | Implement /health |

