## 11. FEW-SHOT PATTERNS

### Architecture Decision

❌ BAD - No rationale:
```
Using System + Process API pattern.
```

✅ GOOD - Evidence-based:
```
Using System + Process API pattern.
Rationale: Customer requires orchestration across Salesforce and SAP
(stated in requirements). Volume justifies batch with process layer.
```

**Why**: Architecture decisions without rationale are unverifiable.

### Field Mapping

❌ BAD - Assumed mapping:
```
| firstName | first_name | Direct |
```

✅ GOOD - Evidence-cited mapping:
```
| firstName | first_name | Direct | Per source sample record 1 |
```

**Why**: Every mapping must trace to actual source/target data.

